  "note": "With Q0 in place of r, δ0Q0² ≤ x/2 makes the arcs disjoint mod 1: the half-widths at a/q and a'/q' sum to (q+q')δ0Q0/(qq'x) ≤ 1/(qq'). So (12.3) is an equality."
